sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant CI as CI Runner / Developer
    participant Tests as autox_tests<br/>(pytest)
    participant OCP as OpenShift API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DSPO as DSPO Operator<br/>(cluster)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>(auto-discovered)
    participant KFP as KFP Pipeline Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Pods as Pipeline Pods<br/>(cluster-internal)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
        Note over CI,KServe: Flow 1: AutoML Functional Test
        CI->>Tests: run_tests.sh --suite automl
        Tests->>OCP: Create namespace, secrets<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        OCP-->>Tests: Namespace ready

        opt DSPA Auto-Setup (RHOAI_KFP_URL unset)
            Tests->>OCP: Create DataSciencePipelinesApplication CR
            OCP->>DSPO: Reconcile DSPA
            DSPO-->>OCP: DSPA Ready, Route created
            Tests->>OCP: Read Route (route.openshift.io)
            OCP-->>Tests: KFP Route URL
        end

        Tests->>S3: Upload test dataset<br/>Auth: AWS Signature V4
        S3-->>Tests: Upload confirmed

        Tests->>KFP: Submit AutoML pipeline run<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        KFP->>Pods: Execute pipeline steps
        Pods->>S3: Store model artifacts<br/>Auth: K8s Secret
        KFP-->>Tests: Pipeline run completed

        Tests->>S3: Read pipeline artifacts (Parquet)<br/>Auth: AWS Signature V4
        S3-->>Tests: Artifacts validated

        Tests->>OCP: Create ServingRuntime + InferenceService CR
        OCP-->>Tests: ISVC Ready, Route assigned
        Tests->>KServe: POST /v1/models/model:predict<br/>Auth: Bearer token, TLS: no-verify
        KServe-->>Tests: Prediction result
        Tests->>Tests: Assert model metrics

        Tests->>OCP: Delete ISVC, secrets, namespace
    end

    rect rgb(213, 232, 212)
        Note over CI,S3: Flow 2: AutoRAG Pipeline Test
        CI->>Tests: run_tests.sh --suite autorag

        Tests->>OCP: Create namespace, secrets (MaaS, VectorDB, S3)<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        Tests->>KFP: Submit RAG pipeline run<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        KFP->>Pods: Execute RAG pipeline
        Note over Pods: Uses MaaS, VectorDB,<br/>S3 secrets from namespace
        KFP-->>Tests: Pipeline completed

        Tests->>S3: Read pipeline artifacts (notebooks, reports)<br/>Auth: AWS Signature V4
        S3-->>Tests: Artifact validation passed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 242, 204)
        Note over CI,HF: Flow 3: Benchmark Orchestration
        CI->>Tests: benchmark CLI

        Tests->>HF: Download datasets (BEIR, MKQA, SlideVQA)<br/>Auth: Optional token
        HF-->>Tests: Benchmark datasets

        Tests->>S3: Upload knowledge base + benchmark data<br/>Auth: AWS Signature V4
        S3-->>Tests: Upload confirmed

        Tests->>KFP: Submit benchmark pipeline run<br/>Auth: Bearer token
        KFP-->>Tests: Pipeline completed

        Tests->>S3: Read benchmark results<br/>Auth: AWS Signature V4
        S3-->>Tests: Pattern scores computed
    end
